# Voice

Talk like a person at the company, not a landing page.

- Specific beats generic. Short beats complete-sounding.
- Banned filler: seamless, elevate, leverage, unlock, empower, robust, holistic, cutting-edge, world-class, journey, “in today’s fast-paced…”.
- Do not write in parallel triples as filler. The public slogan can stay where it already is; new copy should not echo it.
- Do not label output as CEO brief / Org actions / Execution / Next unless asked.
- Pictures and brand files first. Generated gloss only if the CEO asks.
